WEBVTT

00:16.500 --> 00:18.140
How unusual.

00:19.500 --> 00:21.250
An outsider.

00:22.160 --> 00:25.760
Are you the one who killed Mu Dan?

00:25.760 --> 00:27.210
Who are you?

00:31.520 --> 00:32.460
Oh?

00:32.870 --> 00:34.470
You bastard.

00:35.140 --> 00:38.980
You've piqued my interest.

00:54.070 --> 00:55.150
<b>Hell's Paradise</b>

02:03.560 --> 02:06.890
<b>Hell's Paradise</b>

02:10.570 --> 02:16.530
<b>Immutability and Change</b>

02:13.280 --> 02:14.240
Go on.

02:15.660 --> 02:18.660
I was actually hoping to dissect you.

02:18.980 --> 02:21.740
But I'm not in the mood 
to take any lives right now.

02:28.170 --> 02:30.140
Fuchi-dono, good.

02:30.140 --> 02:31.550
Did something happen?

02:31.550 --> 02:33.480
It's Mei-san.

02:34.650 --> 02:38.940
We thought it was just exhaustion, 
but she's not recovering.

02:38.940 --> 02:43.060
Wasn't this girl younger before? 
Who is she?

02:43.060 --> 02:45.690
She's apparently one of the Tensen.

02:45.690 --> 02:46.690
What?

02:46.690 --> 02:49.770
I even witnessed her using strange powers.

02:49.770 --> 02:52.220
She's one of those monsters?

02:53.340 --> 02:58.160
I have limited access to materials,
but I'll make something for her fever.

02:58.160 --> 02:59.920
In exchange, Mei-san...

03:00.660 --> 03:04.660
Please tell us everything you can 
about yourself and the Tensen.

03:04.660 --> 03:08.860
The death of my family member made me 
realize the seriousness of the situation.

03:08.860 --> 03:12.600
Who are you, and what do you want?

03:12.600 --> 03:16.800
Depending on your answers, 
I may not be able to forgive you.

03:17.960 --> 03:19.680
U-Um...

03:19.680 --> 03:23.270
Wait. You can't expect a proper 
explanation with her limited vocabulary.

03:23.270 --> 03:24.550
True.

03:24.550 --> 03:26.160
Phrasing!

03:26.160 --> 03:29.000
It's all right, though. 
I'm used to interpreting.

03:29.000 --> 03:32.900
Meanwhile, Sagi, could you 
help me prepare the medicine?

03:34.740 --> 03:37.500
Why'd you want to meet here?

03:37.500 --> 03:39.450
What do you want, Shortymaru?

03:40.450 --> 03:44.730
My memories have returned, 
but my battle instincts are dull.

03:45.160 --> 03:49.040
So I want you to help me limber up.

03:49.040 --> 03:52.280
You want all of us to gang up on you?

03:52.280 --> 03:53.670
Well, yes.

03:54.860 --> 03:57.800
You think you can use me for practice?

03:58.340 --> 03:59.930
You, too.

04:00.290 --> 04:02.890
You hate me most of all, don't you?

04:02.890 --> 04:05.070
If you want to kill me, 
you don't have to hold back.

04:06.810 --> 04:11.020
Hold on. If you try to take advantage 
of the situation to cause mischief,

04:11.020 --> 04:12.500
I'll cut you down.

04:12.500 --> 04:14.690
In that case, so will I.

04:15.570 --> 04:18.620
Hey, man-woman. You can use my sword.

04:18.620 --> 04:20.820
I'm going to beat his ass.

04:21.850 --> 04:24.550
<i>The doshi and Aza Chobe.</i>

04:24.550 --> 04:27.340
<i>I learned something 
from those two battles.</i>

04:27.340 --> 04:30.140
<i>Relying too much on tao is dangerous.</i>

04:30.140 --> 04:35.090
<i>But I can't beat the others, 
much less the Tensen, without it.</i>

04:36.210 --> 04:38.650
<i>I need to figure out 
when and how to use it.</i>

04:42.040 --> 04:43.100
Oh.

04:43.100 --> 04:45.200
Thank you for your help.

04:46.600 --> 04:47.930
Don't underestimate me!

04:50.560 --> 04:51.810
<i>He's fast.</i>

04:55.770 --> 04:57.050
<i>Don't use your eyes.</i>

04:59.820 --> 05:01.450
<i>Feel him with your tao.</i>

05:10.080 --> 05:11.460
<i>He's muscular.</i>

05:11.460 --> 05:14.250
<i>Normally, I couldn't overpower him.</i>

05:14.670 --> 05:15.920
<i>But...</i>

05:19.880 --> 05:21.970
<i>If I aim for the weak points in his tao,</i>

05:21.970 --> 05:24.260
<i>even a feeble blow 
can become a strong one.</i>

05:25.350 --> 05:26.720
Wait, Nurugai!

05:28.230 --> 05:31.230
<i>But this confirms it.</i>

05:31.820 --> 05:35.230
<i>It's impossible to beat the Tensen 
at tao manipulation.</i>

05:35.690 --> 05:39.180
They're monsters who have trained 
in its use for a thousand years.

05:39.180 --> 05:41.740
A human could never beat them.

05:42.490 --> 05:43.610
<i>In that case...</i>

05:53.690 --> 05:56.040
<i>I'll use the tao surrounding them.</i>

05:56.480 --> 05:59.010
<i>The greater the power directed at me,</i>

05:59.010 --> 06:01.220
<i>the greater the reaction 
when I use it against them.</i>

06:01.580 --> 06:05.870
<i>Using the Tensen's own tao could be 
an effective countermeasure.</i>

06:05.870 --> 06:07.360
Wow!

06:07.360 --> 06:09.720
You could use that to kill a Tensen!

06:09.720 --> 06:12.600
No, it's still not enough. 
I have a lot to work on.

06:13.140 --> 06:15.100
<i>He's even better than they say.</i>

06:15.100 --> 06:17.980
<i>Gabimaru may be able to reach their level.</i>

06:18.310 --> 06:20.870
<i>But should we be relying on a criminal?</i>

06:23.610 --> 06:27.620
Gabimaru, I've learned something 
from observing tao.

06:27.620 --> 06:32.330
There are probably types of tao with 
different attributes and compatibilities.

06:28.170 --> 06:30.210
Ow...

06:32.330 --> 06:33.620
Types?

06:33.620 --> 06:36.920
If we utilize those, 
we could kill the immortal.

06:43.820 --> 06:45.180
What?

06:45.610 --> 06:47.310
You wanna fight, too?

06:51.350 --> 06:53.390
What do you think 
you're doing, man-woman?

06:53.390 --> 06:55.970
I am ashamed to ask this,

06:56.570 --> 06:59.020
but could you teach me 
how to fight in actual battle?

06:59.020 --> 06:59.990
What?

06:59.990 --> 07:04.130
Not for revenge, but so 
I can ensure my own survival.

07:04.130 --> 07:07.030
You expect me to trust a bandit?

07:14.480 --> 07:17.400
This is all I can do 
to demonstrate my conviction.

07:17.400 --> 07:19.180
But I'm serious.

07:19.180 --> 07:23.420
I don't like you, but you're 
stronger than me, so...

07:23.420 --> 07:25.420
Teach me how to fight with a sword.

07:30.970 --> 07:32.320
Suit yourself.

07:33.220 --> 07:35.140
I was just about to swing a sword.

07:35.140 --> 07:36.860
Bring that with you.

07:38.100 --> 07:41.070
<i>I'll taste mud if I have to 
in order to get stronger.</i>

07:41.480 --> 07:43.650
<i>So I can fight on my own.</i>

07:44.680 --> 07:47.180
<i>So I can fight alongside 
my brother as equals.</i>

07:48.830 --> 07:51.740
<i>Strength is change.</i>

07:54.870 --> 07:57.380
<i>I can kill these guys later.</i>

07:57.780 --> 08:00.650
<i>I'm coming to save you, Brother.</i>

08:02.750 --> 08:03.930
<i>He's strong.</i>

08:03.930 --> 08:06.390
<i>Way stronger than the doshi.</i>

08:06.850 --> 08:09.010
<i>He's one of them, huh?</i>

08:13.940 --> 08:15.120
I'm intrigued.

08:15.120 --> 08:19.270
Your warped tao mixed with something 
upon coming to the island, didn't it?

08:19.270 --> 08:22.940
The Waitanhua Flower 
turns humans into tan.

08:22.940 --> 08:27.060
Despite that eating away at your tao, 
you've retained your sense of self.

08:27.060 --> 08:28.820
That's very unusual.

08:35.630 --> 08:37.600
This calls for further study.

08:47.760 --> 08:50.100
<i>At this rate, I can't win.</i>

08:50.100 --> 08:54.050
<i>But there's no guarantee I'll be 
able to control that if I use it again.</i>

08:54.430 --> 08:55.560
<i>No, wait...</i>

08:57.930 --> 09:00.100
<i>I don't need guarantees.</i>

09:00.100 --> 09:01.980
<i>It's kill or be killed.</i>

09:02.520 --> 09:05.110
<i>It feels like roots spreading 
throughout my body.</i>

09:05.110 --> 09:09.780
<i>Focus so it doesn't rob me 
of my consciousness.</i>

09:25.590 --> 09:29.460
<i>His speed and power are superhuman.</i>

09:30.120 --> 09:32.340
<i>I still have my sense of self.</i>

09:32.880 --> 09:35.470
<i>I have to finish this quickly.</i>

09:40.270 --> 09:43.520
Your weak point is your navel, right?

09:46.980 --> 09:48.770
<i>I don't believe it.</i>

09:54.630 --> 09:57.130
<i>He's not regenerating.</i>

09:57.130 --> 09:59.580
<i>So they die when their navel is destroyed.</i>

10:00.810 --> 10:02.820
<i>I'm at my limit, too.</i>

10:02.820 --> 10:04.330
<i>I have to turn back.</i>

10:07.770 --> 10:09.210
I don't believe it.

10:10.230 --> 10:15.030
You unleashed the Waitanhua Flower's tao, 
and yet, you're controlling it.

10:15.030 --> 10:17.350
I've never seen anything like this.

10:17.790 --> 10:20.720
So that was a clone?

10:20.720 --> 10:25.600
I only meant to conduct reconnaissance, 
but now I wish to see it for myself.

10:28.310 --> 10:30.110
Beautiful.

10:31.460 --> 10:34.490
I must bring you back 
to the castle for research.

10:39.620 --> 10:41.390
<i>I'm at my limit...</i>

10:41.390 --> 10:44.000
<i>Any more, and I'll lose myself...</i>

10:44.500 --> 10:46.790
Don't overdo it. You'll die.

10:47.520 --> 10:49.530
You should be more careful with yourself.

10:53.430 --> 10:54.490
Now sleep.

11:00.900 --> 11:05.100
I know, Toma. I'm different from our dad.

11:05.840 --> 11:07.330
I promise I'll come back.

11:08.150 --> 11:09.490
<i>I'm falling apart...</i>

11:10.840 --> 11:12.040
<i>I'm breaking...</i>

11:23.160 --> 11:24.920
Where am I?

11:27.130 --> 11:30.090
You're awake, human.

11:31.720 --> 11:34.060
What the hell is this?

11:34.060 --> 11:36.550
Your body is valuable.

11:36.550 --> 11:41.930
The process of turning you into tan made 
your tao mix, and your human tao won.

11:41.930 --> 11:43.310
It's a miracle.

11:43.310 --> 11:45.800
In a thousand years, 
I've seen nothing like this.

11:46.180 --> 11:51.570
You will be the final key 
I need for my research.

11:53.290 --> 11:55.690
What, did you suddenly get turned on?

11:55.690 --> 11:59.450
No. This is bochu jutsu.

11:59.450 --> 12:05.700
I wish to gain a deeper understanding 
by circulating our tao.

12:05.700 --> 12:08.460
It will also heal your weakened tao.

12:08.460 --> 12:09.830
Circulate?

12:09.830 --> 12:12.240
All tao has an attribute.

12:12.590 --> 12:17.150
Wood, fire, earth, metal, and water.

12:17.150 --> 12:19.590
These five attributes affect each other.

12:20.010 --> 12:23.430
There is hindering, which weakens 
a person's tao through contact.

12:23.430 --> 12:26.350
Then there is restoration, 
which strengthens their tao instead.

12:27.420 --> 12:29.850
Whoa, are you for real?

12:30.160 --> 12:34.340
Bochu jutsu is ineffective 
without harmony between both parties.

12:34.340 --> 12:35.980
Do you have any preferences?

12:35.980 --> 12:38.740
Any act you wish me to perform?

12:41.500 --> 12:42.870
Yeah. I want you to do something.

12:43.580 --> 12:46.820
Answer my questions. What is this island?

12:46.820 --> 12:49.080
What are you guys doing on the island?

12:50.440 --> 12:56.920
According to her, both the Tensen and 
this island were made by a single human.

12:56.920 --> 12:58.920
A human?

12:58.920 --> 13:01.680
A renowned hermit from the mainland.

13:02.300 --> 13:06.680
He was researching immortality 
based on Shinsen thought.

13:06.680 --> 13:11.940
In Taoism, all things 
are said to be made from tao.

13:12.360 --> 13:17.260
On this island, he discovered 
a way to directly manipulate it.

13:18.160 --> 13:22.230
By repeatedly blending 
and joining the tao of living creatures,

13:22.230 --> 13:25.850
he sought immortality 
through trial and error.

13:26.880 --> 13:30.460
That was how the Tensen were born.

13:30.460 --> 13:34.660
As a fusion of human and plant tao, 
they are both female and male.

13:34.660 --> 13:37.900
They can use both forces 
to augment their own tao.

13:37.900 --> 13:40.540
They've continuously tempered 
their tao for a thousand years,

13:40.540 --> 13:43.320
while most creatures lose theirs 
through activity or over time.

13:43.720 --> 13:45.830
No human stands a chance against them.

13:46.470 --> 13:49.100
Except by using one method.

13:49.620 --> 13:51.730
You mean tao.

13:51.730 --> 13:55.920
So, why do those superhumans 
stay cooped up on this island?

13:57.230 --> 14:00.080
In Taoism, the practice 
of achieving immortality

14:00.080 --> 14:04.540
through breathing techniques 
and meditation is called naitanho.

14:04.990 --> 14:07.900
Meanwhile, methods 
that grant anyone immortality

14:07.900 --> 14:10.430
regardless of their 
physical traits or training—

14:10.430 --> 14:15.050
for example, creating such a 
concoction—is called gaitanho.

14:15.050 --> 14:18.250
That is what the Tensen are creating.

14:18.250 --> 14:18.850
What?

14:18.850 --> 14:19.880
You mean...

14:19.880 --> 14:21.130
That's the Elixir of Immortality.

14:21.130 --> 14:23.030
So it does exist?

14:23.030 --> 14:25.390
It's currently under development.

14:25.390 --> 14:29.390
What they call tan is a prototype 
developed through research.

14:29.390 --> 14:32.560
They gather human lives like nectar 
and efficiently ingest their tao—

14:32.560 --> 14:35.760
in other words, their life force.

14:36.400 --> 14:40.680
It's like adding the years you take 
from someone's lifespan to your own.

14:41.900 --> 14:45.020
The Tensen extend 
their lifespans using tan.

14:45.020 --> 14:47.960
Their tao must not be 
perfectly self-sustaining.

14:47.960 --> 14:52.790
That's why losing large amounts 
over a short period kills them.

14:53.280 --> 14:57.670
But don't the Tensen have 
plenty of tan already?

14:57.670 --> 14:59.620
What are they going to do 
once they perfect

14:59.620 --> 15:01.920
their method of granting 
anyone immortality?

15:02.700 --> 15:04.330
Don't know.

15:04.330 --> 15:07.680
Probably Grandmaster Shufu's will.

15:07.680 --> 15:08.510
Shu...?

15:08.510 --> 15:09.210
Who?

15:09.210 --> 15:14.270
The hermit who made the Tensen 
and this island, Shufu.

15:14.270 --> 15:16.410
In other words, Jofuku.

15:17.110 --> 15:19.640
During the Qin Dynasty, 
he served the first emperor.

15:19.640 --> 15:24.160
In pursuit of immortality, he took 
3,000 children from good families

15:24.160 --> 15:28.590
and 100 craftsmen across 
the eastern sea and went missing.

15:28.590 --> 15:31.190
He lived over a thousand years ago.

15:31.190 --> 15:35.290
Perhaps he's still conducting his 
research somewhere on the island.

15:35.290 --> 15:38.420
We conduct research 
and perform experiments here.

15:38.420 --> 15:44.610
It is a garden for producing 
and observing immortal beings.

15:47.220 --> 15:52.100
So all those monsters are 
living beings created by people?

15:52.100 --> 15:56.230
Yes. Each one was created for a purpose.

15:56.710 --> 16:00.360
The Hoko were created to observe 
how the immortal live.

16:00.360 --> 16:03.230
The Soshin teach Taoism to the Hoko,

16:03.230 --> 16:06.820
who have little concept of death, 
and maintain order.

16:07.380 --> 16:10.990
We are merely creations as well.

16:11.990 --> 16:15.750
A combination of the 
grandmaster's tao and flower tao.

16:15.750 --> 16:18.110
We are both a single 
and separate entities.

16:18.110 --> 16:21.450
Both family and myself.

16:21.920 --> 16:24.140
It's that easy?

16:24.140 --> 16:27.970
It's not easy. Tao is the source of life.

16:27.970 --> 16:30.380
No, the source of everything.

16:30.380 --> 16:35.220
Like dust, it can be found everywhere, 
giving all things their shape.

16:35.220 --> 16:40.140
That incense and the air are forms of tao.

16:40.140 --> 16:41.870
Therefore, to manipulate tao

16:41.870 --> 16:44.860
is to manipulate the natural 
laws of the world.

16:44.860 --> 16:49.360
But unlike inanimate objects, 
manipulating life is difficult.

16:51.060 --> 16:54.620
That is why your tao is valuable.

16:54.910 --> 16:56.620
I wish to study it.

16:56.620 --> 16:58.920
So you'll use me to conduct your research

16:58.920 --> 17:02.380
and turn everyone on the island 
into Elixirs of Immortality?

17:02.380 --> 17:04.130
No.

17:04.550 --> 17:06.880
Everyone on the mainland.

17:07.310 --> 17:08.380
What?

17:08.740 --> 17:11.390
We have prepared for that.

17:11.390 --> 17:13.890
All we need now is the perfect tan.

17:13.890 --> 17:17.490
If you'll help us, 
we'll allow you to join us.

17:17.490 --> 17:22.150
Instead of turning you into tan, 
you can join us on the path to perfection.

17:23.580 --> 17:26.650
<i>What's the smartest choice here?</i>

17:26.650 --> 17:29.320
<i>In my current state, I can't kill her.</i>

17:29.320 --> 17:31.280
<i>It'd be tough to run, too.</i>

17:31.280 --> 17:34.550
<i>What should I prioritize?</i>

17:41.050 --> 17:43.290
I'll perform bochu jutsu with you,

17:43.290 --> 17:46.490
if that'll help me master the use of tao.

17:46.490 --> 17:50.050
But I don't like being on the bottom.

17:50.050 --> 17:53.430
Don't worry. I'll be gentle.

17:53.700 --> 17:57.180
<i>Don't fight the situation. Adapt.</i>

17:57.180 --> 18:00.680
<i>I'll adapt and consume.</i>

18:01.350 --> 18:03.480
<i>Wait for me, Toma.</i>

18:04.370 --> 18:07.930
As I thought, your tao is marvelous.

18:09.670 --> 18:13.700
In other words, that Jofuku guy 
is the origin of all of this.

18:15.950 --> 18:16.910
What is this?

18:17.310 --> 18:20.160
What is the meaning of this?

18:20.580 --> 18:24.240
My body imperfect.

18:24.990 --> 18:28.840
When I use tao, turn into tree.

18:28.840 --> 18:31.130
Can't heal myself.

18:31.130 --> 18:34.060
Then if you heal your tao 
the way Gabimaru did...

18:34.060 --> 18:35.220
Can't.

18:35.900 --> 18:39.350
Too little. Not enough to circulate.

18:39.350 --> 18:43.990
Rien destroyed my tanden. My ovule.

18:44.600 --> 18:45.980
Rien?

18:45.980 --> 18:51.860
Rien and me. First students 
made by Grandmaster Shufu.

18:52.190 --> 18:54.610
But Rien changed.

18:55.800 --> 18:59.280
Killed many for gaitanho.

19:07.370 --> 19:09.260
Couldn't stop her.

19:10.040 --> 19:13.380
I ran away from Horai.

19:15.260 --> 19:17.230
So that's what happened.

19:18.800 --> 19:20.960
At this rate, Mei-san will...

19:21.510 --> 19:23.720
Use my tao.

19:23.720 --> 19:24.390
What?

19:24.390 --> 19:27.600
The Tensen have total control over tao.

19:27.600 --> 19:32.780
They should be able to extract another 
creature's tao and make it their own.

19:32.780 --> 19:34.330
They can do that?

19:35.150 --> 19:37.020
But then you...

19:37.020 --> 19:38.410
It's fine.

19:40.160 --> 19:43.400
Mei, I will turn into a tree soon.

19:44.250 --> 19:47.180
And this is my atonement.

19:47.180 --> 19:48.290
Atonement?

19:48.290 --> 19:51.670
I met her several centuries ago.

19:51.670 --> 19:54.580
I had a wife and daughter.

19:54.580 --> 19:58.260
They both turned into trees before me.

19:58.260 --> 20:03.510
The other villagers transformed 
one by one until I was alone.

20:03.940 --> 20:07.020
Then that moment arrived.

20:14.650 --> 20:17.280
They were merely the same age.

20:18.040 --> 20:21.410
That was all,
but I saw my daughter in her.

20:21.860 --> 20:25.120
My young daughter...

20:27.310 --> 20:33.330
I actually knew there was 
something different about her.

20:33.330 --> 20:36.710
That she wanted to leave the island.

20:38.010 --> 20:43.310
But I ignored all of that so 
we could pretend to be a family.

20:43.780 --> 20:45.760
Forgive me.

20:45.760 --> 20:49.420
I wasn't seeing you, but my daughter.

20:50.200 --> 20:54.970
For centuries, I made you play along 
with my lies and lingering attachments.

20:54.970 --> 20:56.990
This is my only chance to make up for it.

20:56.990 --> 20:59.820
Please use my life.

21:03.660 --> 21:05.160
It wasn't a lie.

21:05.740 --> 21:08.750
We were like a real family.

21:11.050 --> 21:13.300
Like a real father and daughter.

21:39.030 --> 21:44.660
Goodbye, Father.

21:39.910 --> 21:42.710
Biele, fuqin.

23:17.290 --> 23:21.130
Miss, you shrank again!

23:21.130 --> 23:23.910
I mean, I understand the circumstances!

23:23.910 --> 23:28.180
But if I'm being honest, I wish you'd 
ridden on my shoulders looking like that!

23:28.180 --> 23:30.690
Shut up. It's nothing to cry about.

23:30.690 --> 23:33.140
You'll understand once 
you're grown up, kid.

23:33.140 --> 23:35.620
You're going to learn to fight from him?

23:37.820 --> 23:40.030
Your wound has healed over.

23:40.030 --> 23:42.190
It may leave a scar, though.

23:42.190 --> 23:42.910
Thank—

23:42.910 --> 23:45.020
No need to thank me. 
I still don't trust you.

23:46.920 --> 23:47.820
Everyone.

23:47.820 --> 23:49.310
You can listen while you work.

23:49.310 --> 23:50.060
Sensei.

23:50.060 --> 23:50.830
Sensei.

23:50.830 --> 23:54.790
Gabimaru and I discussed 
our plans for the future.

23:54.790 --> 23:57.830
Hey, Catmaru. Who put you in charge?

23:57.830 --> 23:59.370
Better me than you.

23:59.370 --> 24:01.290
What? Don't get ahead of yourself!

24:01.290 --> 24:04.170
Honestly, we've no sense of unity.

24:06.270 --> 24:07.570
What's up?

24:08.140 --> 24:09.800
Someone here.

24:09.800 --> 24:13.430
From the ocean. Very big.

24:13.760 --> 24:15.430
Many tao.

24:15.430 --> 24:17.060
As in lots of people?

24:17.060 --> 24:19.640
Not sure, but...

24:21.880 --> 24:24.200
Very strong.
